# Python Project 7 (YouTube Video Downloader)

- This program is a graphical YouTube video downloader created using Python and Tkinter.

- It allows the user to paste a YouTube video link into an input field.

- The user can start the download by clicking the DOWNLOAD VIDEO button.

- The program connects to YouTube using the pytubefix library. It automatically selects and downloads the highest available video resolution.

- The downloaded video is saved to a predefined folder in the computer.

- After the download is complete, a confirmation message is displayed on the screen.

